description	"Sora Bulq

A glass cannon Dark Acolyte with strong mobility.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- 15% Faster Swings
- Lightsaber And Shoto (Dual/Purple Styles)
-- Pulls/Cripples/Staggers On Hit
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (1)
-- Chain Limit: 4
-- 30% more special damage
-- BP Free Jumps
-- Saber Throw (2)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (2)
- Grip (2) ^3[CS3]
- Mind Trick (1)
- Dark Rage (3) ^3[CS2]
- Speed (1) ^3[CS4]
-- Speed Lunge

^8Attributes:
- Force Block/Focus (2)
- 2x Knockback Given
- Healing Capped At 35
- Strength (1)
- In-Air Force Regen
- Float Hop & Bunny Hop (1)
- Blast Armor
- Environmental Protection (1)"